      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The urge to \"fix\" things by removing yourself is a powerful, desperate impulse, but it's rooted in a misunderstanding of what selflessness truly means. Stepping away to make them \"shine\" isn't grace; it's a silent sacrifice that denies you the chance to find your own peace. You are not a stain that needs wiping away; you are a person who deserves to be seen, flaws and all, not just as a problem to be managed.",
